[
  {
    "id": "v1t-enable-observations",
    "title": "V1 合测：进关前开启 Y15 层构建观察",
    "host": "any",
    "target": "static:ForgeDevelopment.Native.RecTracerRuntime",
    "requires": [
      "Recorder.Enabled 与 TraceEnabled 开启，TraceAllProfiles 关闭；必须在关卡生成前运行（run-drive-session.py 启动时自动运行）。"
    ],
    "steps": [
      { "call": "SetProfileEnabled", "args": ["author-y15-layer-fields", true] }
    ],
    "notes": [
      "只改变诊断 profile 开关，不创建、移动或删除游戏对象。命令 Passed 只证明开关调用完成；读回另行用 drive_cli 指令。"
    ]
  }
]
